Output demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1340
Set Height 720
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Hide
Type "export PATH=$PWD/node_modules/.bin:$PATH; clear" Enter
Show
Type "# A covered AI-agent job on Base: graded by Jev, settled by Moonbeam" Sleep 500ms Enter
Type "moonbeam demo" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 6s
